- Keep an outgoing Lightning attempt pending while its own native payment is pending.
  An xpay error no longer marks that unresolved payment failed.
  An empty own-payment lookup also retains the current open status and custody.
  A fresh native NoRoute reply can fail its exact call after the qualified CLN
  version acknowledges persistent slow mode; the reply and failure commit
  together. Lost replies and unqualified errors remain unresolved.
  Bound route delay by the higher native or recorded server height and apply
  the existing retry time plus buffer as the RPC deadline. A timed-out RPC
  releases its waiter while native reconciliation retains the payment.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
- Resume an intra-Ark receive after its sender already settled.
  A restart between the sender and receive commits no longer retries a cancelled
  external hold or repeats the sender's success notification.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
- Keep fulfilled receive grants committed and wait for six confirmations in
  both processed views before treating an on-chain revocation as terminal.
  Refuse a first claim inside the existing margin of its earliest grant expiry.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
- Retry failed hold settlements without blocking unrelated durable settlements.
  Timeout processing reports each invoice failure and continues the pass while
  keeping the original payment and retry evidence.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
- Record each Lightning settlement's actual attempt, receive or on-chain source
  with its preimage. Missing or inconsistent provenance holds the affected funds
  instead of authorizing a refund or an operator payout from cached status.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
- Expose durable expiry hold reasons on the private operator listener and through
  `captaind rpc expiry-holds`. Holds remain alarmed and counted until an actual
  decision clears them; listing cannot change a payment or release held funds.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
- Confine invalid expiry ownership to its own terminal and preserve unrelated
  ready outputs when signed split preparation is unavailable. Database and
  allocation failures still propagate. Operator-only sweeps continue without a
  customer payout view, and watchmand refuses Bitcoin nodes without txindex.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
- Derive fallback payouts from admitted joint coin/mailbox bindings and the
  existing stage-entitlement rules. Authenticated mailbox receipts also discover
  provisional input-owner and unmaterialized recipient claims.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
  - **BREAKING:** Registration and legacy-proof dispatch are removed. Use fresh
    matched stores; registration-era databases are refused before writes.
- Bound dust aggregation to currently ready payouts for the same script and
  expiry, ending that hold after 144 blocks in the completed chain view.
  Only committed groups affect pass inclusion, and dropped groups leave their
  unfinished round participations unchanged.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
